<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n106909" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπαν-ίσταμαι</span></b> , 
			Pass.
		 with aor. 2 and pf.
		
			Act.
		, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>rise, stand up,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thgn.
				485
			</span></i>; of game, <i>start up,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				2.4.19
			</span></i>; of land, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπανεστώς</span>”
				<i>rising slightly above the plain,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.510
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖσι πρεσβυτέροισι . . ἐξ ἕδρης
				ὑπανιστέαται</span>
			<i>rise up from</i> their seats <i>to make room</i> or <i>show
				respect to</i> . . , <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.80
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Vit.</u>
				p.38J.
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν θάκων τοῖς πρεσβυτέροις ὑ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Nu.</u>
					993
				</span></i>
			 (anap.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕδρας ὑ. βασιλεῖ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Lac.</u>
					15.6
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. ἀπὸ τῶν θάκων ὁδῶν τε παραχωρεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Hier.</u>
					7.2
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Smp.</u>
				4.31
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καθήμενος ὑ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Mem.</u>
					2.3.16
				</span></i>
			: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θυμὸς ὑπανίστατο</span>”
				<i>gave way,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Callistr.
					<u>Stat.</u>
					13
				</span></i>
			: cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπανάστασις.</span>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>withdraw,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ τῶν Ἀθηναίων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Suid.
				</span></i>
			
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀρίσταρχος.</span>
			
		</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
